    <FactionDef ParentName="FactionBase">
        <defName>OA_RK_Faction</defName>
        <label>Oberonia Aurea Imperial Outpost Colony</label>
        <description>This is one of the outpost colonies established by the Oberonia Aurea Empire in the Milky Way, and in contrast to the Fallen Empire, they have a vibrant society and are willing to cooperate with any friendly group of people. \n\nThe Oberonia Aurea Empire is an extra-galactic Ratkin empire whose home system has been determined not to be in close proximity to the Milky Way. They crossed over through a spatial anomaly at the edge of the galaxy and, after an initial series of frictions, managed to strike an armed colonization deal with the Fallen Empire, eventually establishing their own colony as a buffer zone and outpost in the galaxy. \The Oberonia Aurea Empire originated on a frigid planet, and initially existed in the form of a clan council, but later on, thanks to the development of technology, it managed to get out of its home planet and establish an imperial system. Unlike the galaxies that are constantly at war with each other, the Oberonia Aurea Empire had not experienced any wars or turmoil before arriving in the Milky Way, so their social atmosphere is full of harmony and friendliness, and the people are easy to manage. \n\nToday's Oberonia Aurea Empire has had a lot of in-depth exchanges with the Milky Way, they have a series of unique technology, and have already established their own armed forces modeled after the Milky Way.</description>
        <colorSpectrum>
            <li>(0.88, 0.85, 0.31)</li>
        </colorSpectrum>
